+ * When the custom SpotPass server is enabled, Nintendo's (and NetPass's) SpotPass URLs go to that
+ * server instead. `if_modified_since` is sent as If-Modified-Since when not empty, so a server
+ * can answer 304 when nothing changed. Server certificates aren't checked. Blocks until done,
+ * or until `cancel` becomes true.
+ */
+TaskDownload DownloadTaskFile(const std::string& url, const std::string& if_modified_since,
+                              const std::atomic<bool>& cancel);
+
